/-!
# A105774

A "fractal" transform of the Fibonacci numbers: a(1)=1; then if F(n) < k <= F(n+1), a(k) = F(n+1) - a(k - F(n)) where F(n) = A000045(n).

The 73 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

